Package: ppol6818
Title: Course Setup and AI Agent Launcher for PPOL 6818
Version: 0.3.2
Authors@R: person("Benjamin", "Daniels", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "bd581@georgetown.edu")
Description: Checks a student's sign-ins for GitHub, the course AI agents,
    KoboToolbox and IPUMS, connects Claude Code and Codex to the student's
    R console in a course codespace, keeps the student's course
    repositories up to date, builds the pair minisite, reads and deploys
    KoboToolbox forms from R, and gets IPUMS USA extracts as Parquet files
    read through DuckDB.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite, curl, ipumsr, mcptools, nanonext, ellmer, writexl, DBI, duckdb
